cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CytoWeave in your research, please cite it as below. The Report view writes a methods paragraph with the references for the analyses you used."
title: "CytoWeave"
abstract: "A flow cytometry analysis workbench for conventional, spectral and mass cytometry: gating, compensation, spectral unmixing, acquisition QC, batch normalization, clustering and embeddings, statistics, figures and reports. It runs locally as one self-contained program, needs no other software, and keeps the user's files on their computer."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McDermott
    given-names: Robert
repository-code: "https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/cytoweave"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.8.1
date-released: "2026-10-13"
keywords:
  - flow cytometry
  - spectral cytometry
  - mass cytometry
  - gating
  - compensation
  - spectral unmixing
  - single-cell analysis
